Poach

The descendant-measurement algorithm in apps/chrome/capture.js
are adapted from AnyPoach (https://github.com/MiguelMochizuki/anypoach),
Copyright 2026 Miguel Mochizuki and the AnyPoach contributors, Apache License 2.0.
AnyPoach's extension was itself adapted from Poach. The adaptations here retain
Poach's native client, bridge and data handling, bound measurement storage,
and integrate measurements with Poach's handoff lifecycle.
